462 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 193 0 R/E(Conflict/Resolution: Sofi realizes she has barely gotten any work done and feels frustrated with herself. She decides to look for another place to work and comes across a Focus Bubble. She enters the Bubble and starts a focus session. Her devices automatically become less distracting, with unnecessary notifications blocked while urgent ones can still reach her. With fewer interruptions, Sofi is finally able to concentrate and make progress on her work. At the end of her session, she can see how much her focus has improved and feels proud of what she accomplished.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

